invalid type: string "136\n00:06:35,06 --> 00:06:37,03\nnow for local minimum,\n\n137\n00:06:37,03 --> 00:06:40,00\nI have a different kind of arrow head.\n\n138\n00:06:40,00 --> 00:06:42,06\nSo again, providing the X and Y coordinates\n\n139\n00:06:42,06 --> 00:06:47,05\nfor a local minimum, then the text coordinates\n\n140\n00:06:47,05 --> 00:06:50,05\n so forth, you can keep adding labels.\n\n5